  "name": "Spirit Warrior",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/unarmed-punch-fist-yellow-red.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 17th level, your mastery of spirit and combat allows you to enter a state of pure focus, rendering you an ultimate warrior one with body, mind, spirit, and blade.</p>\n<p>At the start of your turn, you may spend five Spirit points so that for the next minute you may take an extra bonus action on each of your turns.</p>\n<p>In addition, for the duration, once per turn, when you use your Spirit Strike feature, you may ignore the Spirit point cost.</p>\n<p>This ability ends early if you are incapacitated or killed.</p>",
